Package: zyphor-smart-downloads
Version: 1.0.0-r1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Installed-Size: 68
Depends: bash (>= 4.0), cron | cron-daemon, coreutils, util-linux, findutils, file, unzip
Suggests: ffmpeg
Maintainer: Mark Jason Espelita <markjasonespelita@gmail.com>
Description: Automatically organize the Downloads folder of every user
 Runs from cron (every minute, installed by postinst) and sorts finished
 downloads into each user's Pictures, Music, Videos, Documents and
 Documents/PDFs folders. Files that are still being written, held open by a
 program, or that look damaged/truncated are never moved into the final
 folders. Moved files are renamed <date-with-seconds>-<filename>. The scan
 interval (seconds or minutes) is configurable in
 /etc/zyphor-smart-downloads/zyphor-smart-downloads.conf.
